guarantee: T-020 r1#3: from_failure maps KeyStoreUnavailable to InvalidKey (every arm tested)
file: crates/voicen-core/src/post_process/mod.rs
added_by: test-writer
--- old
            FailureReason::InvalidApiKey | FailureReason::KeyStoreUnavailable => {
                SkipReason::InvalidKey
            }
--- new
            FailureReason::InvalidApiKey => SkipReason::InvalidKey,
            FailureReason::KeyStoreUnavailable => SkipReason::NotConfigured,
--- end
